# Normalize all text to LF and pin LF on checkout so core.autocrlf=true on Windows
# never rewrites the working tree to CRLF. Preventive (second-pass audit D7): guards
# byte-sensitive generated site assets and fixtures if any are added later. Binary
# files are auto-detected by text=auto and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fonts and raster images are binary — never touch their bytes.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary

# The hosted Infrix DID context is immutable: infrix core pins its SHA-256 and this repository's
# ns-context test pins the same digest, so no platform may rewrite its bytes.
docs/public/ns/did/v1.jsonld -text
